Compatibility
SprigDB speaks the wire protocols of MySQL, MariaDB, MongoDB, Redis, Neo4j
Bolt, Apache Kafka and AMQP so that their clients connect unchanged.
MySQL, MariaDB, MongoDB, Redis, Neo4j, Kafka and RabbitMQ are trademarks of
their respective owners.
